menu "PPG logger motion classification"

config MOTION_THRESHOLD_MG
    int "Validated moving threshold (mg)"
    range 0 4000
    default 0
    help
        Moving threshold in milli-g produced by tools/calibrate_motion.py.
        Keep this at 0 until controlled trials pass validation. With 0, the
        firmware reports motion status as calibrating and never suppresses BPM.

endmenu
